    <title>Daily Digest 2026-10-08: Show HN: Chloe is a TypeScript AI agent; Show HN: agentc: &lt;1mb static/no-libc, minimal, emb; Kubernetes on Edge Day returns to KubeCon + CloudN</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://islandirie.github.io/my-rss-feed/daily/2026-10-08.html"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Chloe is a TypeScript AI agent&lt;/b&gt; — Agentic tools are changing how software gets built — worth knowing what's newly available and battle-tested. &lt;a href="https://chloejs.org/compare"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: agentc: &amp;lt;1mb static/no-libc, minimal, embeddable agent with Rust/C API&lt;/b&gt; — Expanding what LLMs can interact with — relevant if you're building or using agentic pipelines. &lt;a href="https://github.com/abird-ai/agentc"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kubernetes on Edge Day returns to KubeCon + CloudNativeCon North America 2026&lt;/b&gt; — Kubernetes ecosystem changes can surface new operational patterns or affect your existing clusters. &lt;a href="https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/10/07/kubernetes-on-edge-day-returns-to-kubecon-cloudnativecon-north-america-2026/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: StayLeet – keeping skills sharp in AI coding era&lt;/b&gt; — Design patterns and lessons from production systems — high-leverage reading for senior engineers. &lt;a href="https://stayleet.com/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quoting Ben Affleck&lt;/b&gt; — Flagged as relevant to your interests — read the summary to decide if it's worth your time. &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/7/ben-affleck/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;llm-openai-decisions 0.1a0&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/6/llm-openai-decisions/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introducing Mistral Large 4: Le chonk&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/6/le-chonk/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;CiliumCon is back at KubeCon + CloudNativeCon North America 2026&lt;/b&gt; — Kubernetes ecosystem changes can surface new operational patterns or affect your existing clusters. &lt;a href="https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/10/07/ciliumcon-is-back-at-kubecon-cloudnativecon-north-america-2026/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scans for Atlassian vulnerablity (CVE-2026-21589), (Wed, Oct 7th)&lt;/b&gt; — Active threat or newly disclosed vulnerability — assess whether it affects your environment. &lt;a href="https://isc.sans.edu/diary/rss/33406"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
